@format 1
@id media-loading.common.files-intake
@title Files intake
@section Media loading
@area Common
@entry paths-submitted
@summary Trace PListPathsAdd through media discovery; successful discovery continues into the separate common Docket insertion map.
@related media-loading.common.docket-insertion, media-loading.common.file-pickers, media-loading.common.file-drops, media-loading.in-merge-tab
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag common
@tag files

@alias list = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PList

[paths-submitted] Paths submitted through Files <input>
- Accept file-system paths through PListPathsAdd and synchronously scan them before any docket call @ list.PListPathsAdd(...)
> media-scan

[media-scan] Media path discovery <decision>
- Keep supported existing media files supplied directly, recursively enumerate supplied folders, and skip inaccessible folders after logging the failure @ list.PListMediaScan(...)
? "Supported media discovered" > map:media-loading.common.docket-insertion
? "No supported media" > scan-empty

[scan-empty] Nothing discovered <output>
= PListPathsAdd returns zero without calling LDocketPathsAdd, so no docket, selection, or viewer notification occurs.
